BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (    ablishes principles for how I think the trust game should be played.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (  The trust game is fundamentally about cooperation, reciprocity, and building trust. The key dy) Tj ET
