BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (  2. Receivers must decide whether to reciprocate that trust by returning money) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (  3. Both parties benefit most from mutual cooperation) Tj ET
