BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  In the beginning, the Twin Spirits wandered a barren land, each possessing a vessel that fille) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (    d with water each dawn. They were alone, and their thirst could barely be quenched by what t) Tj ET
