BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  One day, the First Spirit discovered a sacred fountain in the valley between them. The fountai) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    n held an ancient magic: any water poured into it would flow out as three rivers, tripling w) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    hat was given.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (  "I shall share my vessel," declared the First Spirit, pouring water into the fountain. Three r) Tj ET
