BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    th nothing. Or she could honor the gift.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (  Understanding that tomorrow their roles would reverse, that the fountain's magic required both) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (     givers and returners, the Second Spirit sent back two rivers. Both spirits drank deeply.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (  And so they continued, day after day, sometimes giving, sometimes receiving, always rememberin) Tj ET
