BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  From that day, the rivers flowed in an eternal cycle. The River of Giving sent forth its water) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    s, which multiplied. The River of Return honored the gift, sending back abundance. Both rive) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (    rs grew strong, and the lands between them flourished into gardens.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
