BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      In the dawn of the world, two mountains stood apart, each with a sacred spring. The mounta) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (        ins were called Trust and Return, and between them lived a people who knew great thirst.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      The Keeper of Trust discovered that when she poured water from her spring into the valley ) Tj ET
