BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    They loaded carts with wheat and corn, crossing the valley to Sending. "Your trust multiplie) Tj ET
