BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      In the beginning, two rivers flowed from separate mountains-the River of Giving and the Ri) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (        ver of Return. Each was controlled by a guardian spirit who possessed waters that could ) Tj ET
