BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      # The Tale of the River and the Rain) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      In the time before memory, the Rain Cloud held all water in the sky. Each day, Rain receiv) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        ed five droplets from the Great Spring. Rain could keep them safe in the clouds or relea) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        se them to River below.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      One day, Rain grew bold and sent down one droplet. When it touched River, it multiplied in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (        to three. River, grateful for this gift, sent back two droplets which rose as mist to Ra) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (        in. Both were enriched.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      The next day, Rain sent two droplets, which became six in River's keeping. River returned ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (        three, and again both flourished. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      But then came the day of fear. Rain clutched all five droplets tight, trusting no one. Riv) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        er received nothing and had nothing to give. The land grew parched.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      Rain learned that water hoarded in clouds serves no one-not the Rain, not the River, not t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (        he world below. The magic of multiplication only works through the act of giving, and th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (        e cycle only completes through the grace of return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      From that day forward, Rain and River made a covenant: Rain would send what she could spar) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        e, River would honor that trust with fair return, and through their partnership, abundan) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        ce would flow to all.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      *Give freely, return fairly, and prosper together.*) Tj ET
