BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      Here is the myth you wrote in the previous round:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      # The Fountain of Doubled Waters) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      In the dawn of the world, two mountains stood apart, each with a sacred spring. The mounta) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (        ins were called Trust and Return, and between them lived a people who knew great thirst.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (      The Keeper of Trust discovered that when she poured water from her spring into the valley ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (        below, the journey itself blessed the water-by the time it reached the basin, every cupf) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (        ul became three. But the Keeper of Return controlled whether this abundance would flow b) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (        ack upward to Trust's spring, replenishing what was given.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      At first, Trust poured cautiously, and Return kept most of the multiplied waters. Both mou) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (        ntains weakened, their springs running low.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (      Then came a vision: the goddess of the eternal cycle showed them that when Trust gave free) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (        ly and Return gave generously back, the springs never ran dry. The water rose and fell i) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (        n constant renewal, each act of faith creating more than existed before.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      The people learned this sacred rhythm-that trust multiplied becomes abundance, and abundan) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (        ce returned becomes trust renewed. When both mountains honored the cycle, the valley blo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (        omed, and neither spring ever failed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      Thus cooperation creates what isolation cannot: a fountain that flows forever, sustained b) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (        y the courage to give and the wisdom to return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (      Here is the myth the other agent wrote in the previous round:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      # The Tale of the River and the Seeds) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      In the beginning, the First Gardener held five sacred seeds. These seeds could be planted ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (        in their own garden, bringing modest harvest-or they could be cast into the Great River.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      The River possessed ancient magic: any seed that touched its waters would multiply threefo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (        ld before reaching the gardens downstream. But the Gardener could not know what the Rive) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        r would return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      The first Gardener kept all five seeds. Their garden grew, but remained small and lonely.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      The second Gardener cast three seeds into the current. The River, grateful for the trust, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (        multiplied them into nine and returned six downstream-more than the Gardener had sacrifi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        ced. Both gardens flourished.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      The third Gardener, seeing this abundance, sent all five seeds. The River transformed them) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (         into fifteen. But the downstream garden kept everything, and the trusting Gardener star) Tj ET
