BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      They loaded carts with wheat and corn, crossing the valley to Sending. "Your trust multipl) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (        ied our fortune," they said. "We return your kindness, that both our peoples may thrive.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (        ") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      From that season forward, the villages prospered together. Water flowed one way, grain flo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (        wed back, and both were enriched beyond what either could achieve alone.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
