BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (      The goddess Elara descended and spoke to the River of Giving: "Pour your waters forward, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        nd watch them multiply." Trusting her wisdom, the river sent its flow downstream, where ) Tj ET
