BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (        r it. Each Wanderer you meet is different, but your principles should remain steady as s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (        tone.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (      Hana understood: the fountain connects all who approach it. Her choices echo through its w) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        aters. By giving boldly to Galen as she did to Dorian, by returning generously as she di) Tj ET
