BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (      Then came Briar the Bold, who faced a choice other Planters had not dared. "Four seeds has) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (         become our custom," Briar reflected, "but what if I plant all five? What if I show ulti) Tj ET
