BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        verything receive eight from fifteen-always. Those who risk four receive six from twelve) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        -always. The pattern is clear, predictable, trustworthy.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
