BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (        ady generosity, we know the response.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (      Thus the lesson crystallized: In a garden of many wanderers, consistency creates confidenc) Tj ET
